    "description": "Magnetic flow meter (water meter) for metering cold and hot potable water, based on the electromagnetic principle. Consists of a flow sensor type 8705 or 8711 and a measuring transducer with electronic calculator (transmitter) type 8732. Sensor body of stainless and carbon steel with lining of neoprene, polyurethane or PTFE; type 8705 with standard flanges, type 8711 flangeless (wafer), installed with measurement electrodes. Measuring transducer in stainless steel housing with two-row LCD display and four buttons, with impulse and current outputs via two connector cables. Flow sensor and transducer in remote-mount design (connected via cable) or compact design."
